  "description": "A self-configuring sync engine for SQL tables Azure SQL Data Sync can't handle - nvarchar(max)/varbinary(max) indexed keys, rows over Data Sync's 24 MB batch limit. Give it a table name; it introspects the schema, derives a sync plan, and generates reviewable SQL.",
